From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Francois Robbertze <francoisdprob@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 17 Jul 2026 23:54:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix: bump pipewire/libspa 0.6 -> 0.10 to stop pipewire
 monitor SIGABRT

On current PipeWire the monitor crashes in a loop. The old 0.6 bindings panic on a permission bit that newer servers send, and that kills the process. pipewire-rs fixed this in 0.7, so this bumps to 0.10 and updates the few renamed API calls.

Tested live: 0.6 crashes within minutes, 0.10 runs clean.

Fix AI-generated; diagnosed, reviewed, and tested by me.
